    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Freehold Investment Opportunity – Four Apartments, Clonee, Dublin 15\r\n\r\nChurches Estate Agents are delighted to present this excellent freehold investment opportunity to the market. Comprising a block of four spacious two-bedroom apartments this property offers an attractive opportunity for investors, property speculators or purchasers seeking to expand their existing portfolio.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned just off the main street in Clonee Village, Dublin 15 the development is presented in good condition throughout. The property comprises two apartments on the ground floor and two apartments on the first floor with each apartment benefiting from its own private door entrance, surface parking and use of a communal garden.\r\n\r\nThe apartments are laid out in a similar configuration and offer well proportioned accommodation throughout. Each apartment comprises a generous living room, separate fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a main bathroom with three-piece suite and tiled flooring. A spacious entrance hallway incorporating useful storage completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe two first floor apartments enjoy pleasant views over the adjacent green Pitch & Putt course adding to the appeal of the development.\r\n\r\nExternally there is six off-street surface parking bays to the front of the building while all apartments are heated by electric storage heating. Importantly for an investor all four apartments are currently vacant providing flexibility for a purchaser to establish their own\r\nletting strategy.\r\n\r\nEagle Court is ideally located just off the M3 at Junction 4 with the M50 only a short drive away providing excellent access to Dublin City Centre and the wider Dublin region. Dublin Airport is approximately 15–20 minutes drive making the location particularly convenient for commuters and those working in the surrounding business and employment hubs.\r\n\r\nClonee Village itself offers a good selection of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, beauty salons, hairdressers and other everyday services. Aldi and Lidl are also located nearby while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just a few minutes away by car\r\nor bus, providing an extensive range of retail, dining and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area is home to a number of major employers and multinational companies including Meta/Facebook&#39;s Data Centre, Kepak and Avoca supporting strong local demand for residential accommodation.\r\n\r\nWith four self-contained two-bedroom apartments being offered together as one freehold property Eagle Court represents an opportunity to acquire a substantial residential investment in an established and well-connected location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "No. 6 Eagle Court - Top Floor Apartment on left \r\n\r\nFront Garden:     \r\n\r\n-\tCommunal, surface and off street parking, planting\r\n\r\nHall:      \t\t\tc. 3.89 x  3.04m \r\n\r\n-\tLong entrance hall, storage cupboard, wood flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room:    \t  \tc. 4.95 x 5.98m\r\n\r\n-\tBright space, large living area, overlooking pitch and putt course, sliding doors, Juliet Style balcony, wood flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen:     \t\tc. 2.11 x 2.41m\r\n\r\n-\tTo front, separate area, fitted units, to front, built in electric cooking appliances, tiled floor, open plan with living room\r\n\r\nBedroom1:     \t\tc. 3.47 x 3.18m\t            \t(to front)\r\n\r\n-\t Double bedroom, fitted wardrobes, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:     \t\tc.3.59 x 3.66m \t\t(to rear)\r\n\r\n-\tDouble bedroom, fitted wardrobes, over-looking pitch and putt course, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom:     \t\tc. 2.03 x 1.80m\r\n\r\n-\t3x piece suite, shower over bath, tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tFreehold block comprising four apartments\r\n•\tFour spacious two-bedroom apartments\r\n•\tTwo ground-floor and two first-floor apartments\r\n•\tUse of communal garden \r\n•\tAll apartments currently vacant\r\n•\tEach apartment has its own private entrance\r\n•\tSeparate fitted kitchens with integrated appliances\r\n•\tBuilt-in wardrobes in bedrooms\r\n•\tSix off-street parking bays \r\n•\tFirst-floor apartments overlook Pitch & Putt course\r\n•\tElectric storage heating\r\n•\tExcellent transport links via M3 and M50\r\n•\tApproximately 15–20 minutes to Dublin Airport\r\n•\tClose to major employment centres and multinational companies\r\n•\tWalking distance to the amenities of Clonee Village\r\n•\tBlanchardstown Shopping Centre within easy reach\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and by strict appointment only."
